OL,3,GNEWSADouglas Dunn obituary: Poet and
OL,4,Ateacher who wrote about class and grief
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe poet and academic Douglas Dunn,
OL,7,Fwhose work covered working-class lives,
OL,8,FScottish history and landscapes, as
OL,9,Fwell as his grief over the death of his
OL,10,Ffirst wife, has died aged 83.
OL,12,FDunn was born in Inchinnan in
OL,13,FRenfrewshire, and grew up in a council
OL,14,Festate in the village. He left school
OL,15,Fto train as a librarian and, after
OL,16,Fworking in Glasgow and the United
OL,17,FStates, studied English Literature as a
OL,18,Fmature student in Hull.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
