OL,3,GNEWSADouglas Dunn obituary: Poet and
OL,4,Ateacher who wrote about class and grief
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was mentored there by the poet
OL,7,FPhilip Larkin, who both encouraged his
OL,8,Fwriting and employed him as a
OL,9,Flibrarian.
OL,11,FDunn would go on to win the Whitbread
OL,12,FPrize and the Queen's Medal for Poetry
OL,13,Fand was appointed an OBE in 2003.
